{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07976","headline":"古风 三十八 · 李白","name":"古风 三十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤兰生幽园，衆草共芜没。\n虽照阳春晖，复悲高秋月。\n飞霜早淅沥，绿艳恐休歇。\n若无清风吹，香气爲谁发。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07976.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07976","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《李太白集分类补注》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/李太白集分類補註_(四庫全書本)）"}